raw:
The page contradicts itself on shipping. The hero says "Free shipping on every order", but the FAQ says shipping is free only on orders over $50 and smaller orders ship for a flat $5.95.

The other problems on the list don't appear. There are clear CTAs, prices are stated, and the headline is specific. I see no typos, placeholder text, broken images or popups, and the text-only view gives no sign of low contrast or cut-off text.

{"problems": ["contradiction"], "score": 6, "evidence": "The hero says 'Free shipping on every order' but the FAQ says shipping is free only over $50 and otherwise a flat $5.95."}

The page contradicts itself on returns. The hero says "Free returns within 14 days", while the bundle section and FAQ say "Free 60-day returns" and "Return any unworn hoodie within 60 days". Both cannot be true.

None of the other listed problems appear. There are add-to-cart buttons, the price is shown, the headline is clear, and there are no typos, placeholder text, broken images or popups. The text-only format gives no sign of contrast or cut-off problems.

{"problems": ["contradiction"], "score": 7, "evidence": "The hero says free returns within 14 days, but the bundle cards and FAQ promise free 60-day returns."}
